    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2010-12-29",
    "decision_details_body": "Award of Contracts to China National Aero Technology International Engineering Corporation (CATIC-ENG) - the Government of Sri Lanka and the China Development Bank Company Ltd.  (CDB) have signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) to establish a framework for corporation to provide financing for infrastructure development projects, mainly for economic development.  The CDB has agreed to provide US $500 million to finance road projects and Cabinet approval was granted to award 5 contracts for the development of the following roads, utilizing US $ 152 million which will be made available immediately:\r\n\r\n\t\t*\tBeliatta - Tangalle Road ) 15.97 km \r\n\t\t*\tBopale Junction - Kiri Ibbana - Udamauara Road ) \r\n\t\t*\tConstruction of a Flyover at Siribopura Junction \r\n\t\t*\tPelawatta - Kankotoya Watta - Thiniyawala - Morawaka Road - 47 km \r\n\t\t*\tHorawala - Pelawatta - Pitigala Road - 17.50 km\r\n\t\t*\tThiruwanaketiya - Agalawatta Road  - 33.45 km \r\n\t\t*\tBadulla - Karametiya - Andaulpotha Road - 47.98 km \r\n\t\t*\tKandy - Mahiyangana - Padiyatalawa Road - 29.13 km\r\n\t\t*\tKalkudah Road )  10.05 km \r\n\t\t*\tKalkudah - Valachchenai Road )"
  },
  {
