    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-02-15",
    "decision_details_body": "- based on the recommendations of an Officials' Committee and on  a proposal made by Hon. Dayashritha Tissera, Minister of State Resources and Enterprise Development,  plans are being prepared for the development of the above institutions on long-term lease basis and to find investors for the purpose.  Until such time this work is finalized, Cabinet approval was granted to provide funds by the General Treasury in the following manner for the payment of salaries to the employees:\r\n\r\n*\tEmbilipitiya Paper Mills\t-\tfrom January to June 2011 at the rate of  4.3 million per month; \r\n\r\n*\tKantale Sugar Industries\t-\tfrom January to June 2011 at the rate of  01 million per month; and \r\n\r\n*\tCeylon Ceramics Corporation-\tfrom January to June 2011 at the rate of  09 million per month."
  },
