    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-03-30",
    "decision_details_body": "- This Act \twhich was passed by Parliament in 2006, has introduced provisions to counteract the \thigh incidence of payment card frauds and for investigation, prosecution and \tpunishment of offenders. Provisions under this Act provides powers for the Minister \tin charge of the subject to make regulations with the approval of Parliament, to \tappoint a Panel of Experts with qualifications in electronic engineering or software \tengineering to assist the police in investigations under this Act. The proposal made \tby H.E. the President to present such regulations in Parliament was approved by the \tCabinet."
  },
  {
