    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-06-29",
    "decision_details_body": "- the objectives of this programme are as follows: \r\n\r\n*\tto provide an integrated policy framework towards promoting employment. \r\n*\tto enable all men and women to attain full productive and freely chosen employment and work. \r\n*\tto promote productivity among our people to improve competitiveness and enhance employability. \r\n*\tto provide fullest possible opportunities to a worker to qualify for and to use his/her skills in a job for which he/she is well suited. \r\n\r\nThe above proposal made by Hon. D.E.W. Gunasekara, Minister (Senior) for Human  Resources, was approved by the Cabinet."
