    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-08-17",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made by Hon. S.B. \tDissanayake, Minister of Higher Education, to implement the following \tprojects pertaining to the Universities of Peradeniya, Kelaniya and Colombo, \twas approved by the Cabinet: \r\n\r\n*\tproposed  Clinical Research and Services Laboratory, Faculty of Medicine, University of Peradeniya - this will be a 2 storied building costing Rs.50.8 million; \r\n\r\n*\tproposed Gymnasium, University of Kelaniya - this will include an Indoor Sports Centre  and the total cost is Rs.50 million; and,\r\n\r\n*\tconstruction of the 4th floor to the University of Colombo School of Computing Building Complex - the cost of the project is Rs.57 million."
