    "decision_details_body": "- Negotiations have been completed for bilateral Air Services between Sri Lanka Philippines and the proposal made by Hon. Piyankara Jayaratne, Minister of Civil Aviation to sign the relevant Air Services Agreement, was approved by the Cabinet."
