    "decision_details_body": "- Cabinet noted the progress of the programme of purchasing paddy in the Yala Season 2011, presented by Hon. Jonston Fernando, Minister of Co-operatives and Internal Trade, giving the following details totaling to 5889 MT. as at 23.08.2011: \r\n\r\n\t\t*\tPolonnaruwa Region\t-\t\t1181 MT\r\n\t\t*\tNorth Western Region\t-\t\t206   MT\r\n\t\t*\tAmpara Region\t\t-\t\t 971  MT\r\n\t\t*\tAnuradhapura Region\t-\t\t 436  MT\r\n\t\t*\tSouthern Region\t\t-\t\t 3009 MT\r\n\t\t*\tNorthern Region\t\t-\t\t     78 MT\r\n\r\n\tThe Paddy Marketing Board expects to purchase 75,000 MT. of paddy during the 2011 Yala Season."
