    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-09-07",
    "decision_details_body": "-  this action plan has been prepared in consultation with and the cooperation of the relevant stakeholders of the Government as well as the civil society. This document not only provides a detailed policy and a legislative programme to realize  the fundamental rights and freedoms provided in the Constitution, but also looks to expand these rights and freedoms. This action plan mainly focuses on the following: \r\n\r\n\t\t*\tCivil and Political Rights;\r\n\t\t*\tEconomic Social and Cultural Rights;\r\n\t\t*\tPrevention of Torture;\r\n\t\t*\tRights of Women;\r\n\t\t*\tMigrant Workers;   \r\n\t\t*\tChildren; and,\r\n\t\t*\tInternally Displaced Persons.\r\n\r\n\tThe above Action Plan presented by Hon. Mahinda Samarasinghe, Minister of Plantation Industries, was approved by the Cabinet."
