    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2012-07-04",
    "decision_details_body": "- provision of relief to the people living in the districts of Anuradhapura and Polonnaruwa in the North Central Province and also those in other districts affected by the recent drought, was discussed.  Some of the urgent measures to be taken in this regard are as follows:\r\n\r\n*\tdredging of major irrigation reservoirs so as to increase there water retention capacities;\r\n\r\n*\tattending to renovation work of canal systems of major irrigation works;\r\n\r\n*\trenovation of agricultural wells;\r\n\r\n*\tprovision of water pumps to locations where necessary;\r\n\r\n*\tproviding seed paddy free of charge to affected farmers, for the next cultivation season; and\r\n\r\n*\tengaging members of affected families between the ages of 18 \tand 60, in renovation work in the respective areas, making \tcash payments for the work done.\r\n\r\n\tIt was also decided to appoint an Officials' Committee consisting of the Secretaries of the following Ministries, to oversee the expeditious implementation of the above:\r\n\r\n\t*\tMinistry of Irrigation and Water Resources Management;\r\n\t*\tMinistry of Economic Development;\r\n\t*\tMinistry of Agriculture;\r\n\t*\tMinistry of Agrarian Services and Wildlife; and\r\n\t*\tMinistry of Disaster Management."
