    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2013-05-09",
    "decision_details_body": "the proposal made by Hon. Maithripala Sirisena, Minister of Health, for the need to strengthen the \nactions taken by the Ministries mainly on the following for the prevention of the spread of Dengue \ndisease, was approved by the Cabinet. \n Ministry of Defence and Urban Development\n \n*\tregular participation of Officials of the Police Department in inter-sectoral meetings at District and Divisional levels.\n \n*\tassisting health and other authorities in cleaning up campaigns in high risk Grama Niladhari Divisions.\n \n\n \nMinistry of Health\n \n*\tcoordinating and facilitating of other sectors;\n \n*\tearly diagnosis and management of epidemics; \n \n*\tformation of village committees together with other relevant sectors.\n \n\n \n Ministry of Environment and Renewable Energy\n \n*\tintroduction of waste recycling system in all Local Authority areas.\n \n\n \nMinistry of Local Government and Provincial Councils (through Local Authorities)\n \n*  \tproper disposal of waste; and\n \n*  \tconduct of Dengue Review Meetings at Local Authority level.\n \n\n \nMinistry of Public Administration and Home Affairs (through District and Divisional Secretaries) \n*\tformation of mosquito prevention committees in every Grama Niladhari Division; and\n \n*\tconduct of regular inter-sectoral meetings at District and Divisional levels.\n \n\n Ministry of Education\n \n*\tregular cleaning up of school premises."
