    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2013-07-11",
    "decision_details_body": "a loan of US$ 75 million (approximately 9.6 billion) is to be obtained from the Asian Development Bank for the improvements of 5 access roads to the Southern Expressway.\u00a0 In addition 33.5 km of the following 5 National Highways linking to 3 interchanges of the Southern Expressway are to be improved under this project:*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Moratuwa - Piliyandala - 2.5 km*\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Ratmalana - Mirihana\u00a0\u00a0 - 2.1 km*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Southern Expressway\u00a0 - Mathugama - 12.4 km*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Kirulapona - Homagama - 2.1 km*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Kesbewa - Pokunuwita\u00a0 -\u00a0 14.4 kmThe above proposal made by H.E. the President, in his capacity as the Minister of Finance and Planning, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
