    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2015-03-04",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by Hon. Duminda Dissanayake, Minister of Irrigation and Agriculture, to present a pot of plant suitably prepared for easy cultivation to the people at a concessionary price amounting to Rs.25/-, instead of distributing vegetable seeds and to provide relief for seeds requirement to encourage farmers engaged in vegetable cultivation on commercial basis in selected lands in extent up to \u00bd acre, with a view to popularizing home garden concept, arresting the escalation in vegetable prices and to maintaining a fair price throughout the year, was approved by the Cabinet."
