    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by Mr. Gayantha Karunathilaka, Minister of Mass Media and Parliamentary Affairs, to sign a Memorandum of Understanding between Sri Lanka and the Government of State of Qatar with a view to developing bilateral corporation in the field of news exchange\tbetween the two countries, in parallel with the official visit of Sheikh Tamim bin Hamad Al Thani, the Emir of the State of Qatar scheduled on 24th March 2015, was approved by the Cabinet."
