    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2019-03-19",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by Hon. Arjuna Ranatunga, Minister of Transport & Civil Aviation to award the contract for the replacement of Chillers, Cooling Tower, Pumps, Pipes with Ancillary items in the Chiller Plant in the Room No: 2KK1 of the Departure Terminal Building at the Bandaranaike International Airport, to M/s Softlogic Retail (Pvt.) Ltd., in accordance with the recommendation of the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee (SCAPC), was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
