    "description": "Procurement of Drug Injections used in the treatment of Kidney Patients",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=9635",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2019-03-19",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by Hon. (Dr.) Rajitha Senaratne, the Minister of Health, Nutrition & Indigenous Medicine, for the procurement of 850,000 Epoetin Injections used in the treatment of Kidney patients, from M/s Reliance Life Science of India, for a sum of US$ 918,000, in accordance with the recommendation of the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee (SCAPC), was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
