    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-02-05",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Minister of Skills Development, Employment and Labour Relations,  to present the following Recommendations and the Convention adopted at the 108th and 106th session of the International Labour Conference, in Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet. \n\n\tAt the 108th session of the International Labour Conference held in the year 2019 : \n\nConvention 190\t-\tConvention concerning the Elimination of Violence and Harassment in the World of Work \n\nRecommendation 206\t-\tRecommendation concerning the Elimination of Violence and Harassment in the World of Work\n\n\tAt the 106th session of the International Labour Conference held in the year 2017 : \n\nRecommendation 205\t-\tRecommendation concerning Employment and Decent Work for Peace and Resilience"
  },
  {
