    "date_str": "2020-09-02",
    "description": "Appointment of the Cabinet Sub-Committee on Investment Promotion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=10592",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-09-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- Expansion of domestic and foreign investments facilities towards a production economy of exports and imports substitution, which would benefit all parties while eradicating poverty through the National Development Programme stated in the Policy Statement 'Vistas of Prosperity and Splendour' is a priority of the Government. Accordingly, the proposal made by H.E the President to appoint the Cabinet Sub-Committee on Investment Promotion chaired by H.E. the President and comprising of the following members of the Cabinet of Ministers to provide policy and practical solutions for the same, was approved by the Cabinet. \t\n      \n*\tHon. Mahinda Rajapaksa\n\tthe Prime Minister\n\tMinister of Finance and\n\tMinister of Urban Development & Housing\n\n*\tHon. Douglas Devananda\n\tMinister of Fisheries\n\n*\tHon. Gamini Lokuge\n\tMinister of Transport\n\n*\tHon. Bandula Gunawardena \n\tMinister of Trade\n\n*\tHon. Dullas Alahapperuma \n\tMinister of Power\n\n*\tHon. Johnston Fernando\n\tMinister of Highways\n\t\n*\tHon. Wimal Weerawansa\n\tMinister of Industries \n\n*\tHon. Mahinda Amaraweera\n\tMinister of Environment\n\n*\tHon. S.M. Chandrasena\n\tMinister of Lands \n\n*\tHon. Wasudeva Nanayakkara\n\tMinister of Water Supply\n\n*\tHon. Udaya Prabhath Gammanpila\n\tMinister of Energy\n\n*\tHon. Ramesh Pathirana\n\tMinister of Plantation\n\n*\tHon. Prasanna Ranatunga\n\tMinister of Tourism \n\n*\tHon. Rohitha Abegunawardhana\n\tMinister of Ports & Shipping\n\n*\tHon. Ali Sabry\n\tMinister of Justice\n      \n      Further, Cabinet granted its approval for the following State Ministers to be attended to the deliberations of the above Cabinet Sub\u2011Committee: \n      \n*\tHon. Duminda Dissanayaka\n\tState Minister of Solar Power, Wind and Hydro Power Generation Projects Development\n\n*\tHon. Jayantha Samaraweera\n\tState Minister of Warehouse Facilities, Container Yards, Port Supply Facilities and Boats and Shipping Industry Development\n\n*\tHon. Dilum Amunugama\n\tState Minister of Vehicle Regulation, Bus Transport Services and Train Compartments and Motor Car Industry\n\n*\tHon. D.V. Chanaka\n\tState Minister of Aviation and Export Zones Development\n\n*\tHon. Nalaka Godahewa\n\tState Minister of Urban Development, Coast Conservation, Waste Disposal and Community Cleanliness \n\n*\tHon. Ajith Nivard Cabraal\n\tState Minister of Money & Capital Market and State Enterprise Reforms."
  },
