    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-09-16",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet considered the proposal made by the Minister of Mass Media to\tpurchase machinery required for the printing of passports and\tconfidential \tdocuments required for the Government by the Government\tPrinting Department itself \tenabling to retain the foreign exchange outflow\twithin the country, since they are currently being printed by foreign printing\tinstitutions and decided to assign the Department of National Planning to\tconduct a detailed evaluation of the project."
