    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-10-05",
    "decision_details_body": "-The Cabinet, at its meeting held on 2020\u201101\u201108 granted approval to award the contract for the procurement of Pre-filled Syringes of Enoxaparin Sodium Injection used for the treatment of patients with heart diseases to M/s ABC Pharma Services (Pvt) Ltd. Accordingly, the relevant order has been issued to the supplier on 2020\u201102\u201124.\n\n\tHowever, it was later confirmed that there is a need for another 160,000 \tsyringes of the same drug. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of \tHealth to award the procurement for the supply of 160,000 Pre-filled Syringes \tof Enoxaparin Sodium Injection 4,000 IU in 0.4ml to the same supplier, M/s \tABC Pharna Services (Pvt) Ltd. as a repeat order at a sum of Rs. 126.96 \tmillion as recommended by the  Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement \tCommittee, \twas approved by the Cabinet."
