    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-11-16",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet, at its meeting held on 2018\u201101\u201109 has granted approval to amend the regulations issued in 1956 pertaining to the \tImmigration and Emigration Act No. 20 of 1948 so as to suit with present. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of \tIrrigation and State Minister of Internal Security, Home Affairs and \tDisaster Management to present the amended Bill prepared by the Legal Draftsman for the purpose in Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
