    "doc_id": "2021-05-31-007-en",
    "num": "7",
    "date_str": "2021-05-31",
    "description": "Awarding term contracts for fuel purchasing",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11082",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-05-31",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet approved the  proposals made by the Minister of Energy to award the following term contracts relating to the purchase of fuel for the period of eight months from 2021\u201106\u201101 to 2022\u201101\u201131 as recommended by the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee. \n\n\t\t*Awarding the term contract for the import of 2,700,000+10/-5% of \t\t  Gasoline (92 Unl) to M/s Swiss Singapore Overseas Enterprises Pte. \t\t  Ltd., \tSingapore.\n\n\t\t*Awarding the term contract for the Single Berth Delivery of \t\t\t1,120,000+10/-5% Bbls of Gas oil (0.05% of maximum sulphur) at \t\t\tSPM Muthurajawela to M/s Petrochina International (Singapore) Pte. \t\tLtd., Singapore.\n\n\n\t\t*Awarding the term contract for the import of 1,341,000+10/-5% of \t\t  Gasoline (92 Unl) and 459,000+10/-5% of Gasoline (95 Unl) to M/s \t\tPetrochina International (Singapore) Pte. Ltd., Singapore.\n\n\t\t*Awarding the term contract for the for \tDuel Berth Discharge of\t\t1,120,000+10/-5% Bbls of Gas oil (0.05% of maximum sulphur) at \tDolphin Tanker Berth (DTB) and SPM \tMuthurajawela, to \tM/s \tPetrochina International (Singapore) Pte. Ltd., Singapore."
  },
  {
