    "date_str": "2021-07-05",
    "description": "Awarding of the contract for the phase II of Multi-Storied Car Park & Mixed Development Project at Colombo Fort",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11140",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-07-05",
    "decision_details_body": "- Bids have been invited for the Design & Construction of Super Structure of Multi\u2011Storied Car Park & Mixed Development Project at Colombo Fort \u2011 Phase II, following the National Competitive Bidding Procedure. As such, the proposal made by the Hon. Prime Minister in his capacity as the Minister of Urban Development & Housing to award the relevant contract to M/s. Tudawe Brothers (Pvt.) Ltd., the lowest bidder, as recommended by the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
