    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-07-19",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Minister of Finance to submit Orders published under the following Gazette Notifications in Parliament for approval, was approved by the Cabinet.\n\ni\tThe following Gazette Notifications issued under the Airports \tDevelopment Levy \tAct, No. 18 of 2011\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2216/3 dated 2021\u201102\u201122\n\n \t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2218/51 dated 2021\u201103\u201109\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2219/68 dated 2021\u201103\u201119\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2224/8 dated 2021\u201104\u201119\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2231/19 dated 2021\u201106\u201111\n\nii\tThe following Gazette Notifications issued under the Excise (Special \tProvisions) Act, No. 13 of 1989\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2222/2 dated 2021\u201104\u201105\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2222/3 dated 2021\u201104\u201105\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2224/24 dated 2021\u201104\u201122\n\niii\tThe following Gazette Notifications issued under the Special \tCommodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2223/2 dated 2021\u201104\u201113\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2225/1 dated 2021\u201104\u201126\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2225/8 dated 2021\u201104\u201127\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2225/13 dated 2021\u201104\u201127\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2228/3 dated 2021\u201105\u201117\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2232/3 dated 2021\u201106\u201114\n\niv\tThe following Gazette Notifications issued under the Revenue \tProtection Act, No. 19 of 1962\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2224/25 dated 2021\u201104\u201122\n\n\t*\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2228/2 dated 2021\u201105\u201117."
