    "doc_id": "2021-09-13-008-en",
    "num": "8",
    "date_str": "2021-09-13",
    "description": "Paddy Purchasing Programme in the Yala Season - 2021",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11245",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-09-13",
    "decision_details_body": "- Paddy harvesting in the Yala Season \u2011 2021 has been commenced by now and the Cabinet decided to take action to purchase Nadu paddy at Rs.55/- per kg by the Paddy Marketing Board with a view to purchasing paddy harvest of the farmers at a competitive price and to convert the stocks of paddy so purchased to rice and sell to the consumers at a reasonable price through the outlet network of Lanka Sathosa Limited."
  },
  {
