    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Minister of Finance to present the following Gazette Notifications which include the Orders published under the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007 with a view to stabilizing the market price, providing relief to the consumers and protecting the local agriculture, in Parliament for approval.\n\n(i)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2236/66 dated 2021\u201107\u201118; \n\n(ii)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2240/20 dated 2021\u201108\u201111; \n\n(iii)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2244/8 dated 2021-09\u201107; \n\n(iv)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2249/3 dated 2021\u201110\u201111; \n\n(v)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2249/16 dated 2021\u201110\u201113; \n\n(vi)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2252/9 dated 2021\u201111\u201102; and\n\n(vii)\tGazette Extraordinary Notification No.2252/25 dated \t2021\u201111\u201102."
  },
  {
