    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2022-02-14",
    "decision_details_body": "- It was decided by the Cabinet to grant its concurrence for the measures taken by H.E. the President to appoint a Committee comprising the following members, to submit policy recommendations and solutions required for ensuring the supply of essential Consumer Goods to the market without shortage:\n\n*   \tHon. Minister of Finance - Chairman\n*\tHon. Minister of Trade\n*\tHon. Minister of Agriculture\n*\tHon. Minister of Ports & Shipping\n*\tHon. State Minister of Co-operative Services, Marketing Development and Consumer Protection \n*\tHon. State Minister of Ornamental Fish, Inland Fish  & Prawn Farming, Fishery Harbour Development, Multiday Fishing Activities and Fish Exports \n*\tHon. State Minister of Livestock, Farm Promotion and Dairy & Egg Related Industries."
