    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2022-02-14",
    "decision_details_body": "- Cabinet noted the necessity of identifying the alternative methods of importing essential food items and the raw materials and industrial goods required for export oriented industries, when the Cabinet Memorandum on \u201cEconomy 2022 and the way forward\u201d submitted by the Minister of Finance was taken up for the discussion at the meeting held on 2022\u201101\u201103. Accordingly, it was decided to grant the concurrence of the Cabinet for the measures taken by H.E. the President to appoint the following Cabinet Sub\u2011Committees to deliberate with countries from which such Goods are imported to the country: \n\n(i)\tto deliberate with the Government of People's Republic of China:\n\n*\tHon. Foreign Minister - Chairman\n*\tHon. Minister of Trade\n*\tHon. Minister of Industries\n*\tHon. Minister of Plantation\n\n(ii)\tto deliberate with the Government of Japan :\n*\tHon. Foreign Minister - Chairman\n*\tHon. Minister of Health\n*\tHon. Minister of Mass Media\n*\tHon. Minister of Highways\n\n\t(iii)\tto deliberate with the Middle Eastern States :\n\n*\tHon. Foreign Minister - Chairman\n*\tHon. Minister of Youth & Sports and Minister of Development Coordination and Monitoring\n*\tMinister of Justice"
  },
  {
