    "description": "Report of the Committee of Experts appointed to draft a new Constitution",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11580",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2022-05-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet at its meeting held on 2020 09 09 has decided to appoint a Committee chaired by Mr. Romesh De Silva, President's Counsel, comprising of legal experts to draft a new Constitution. Accordingly, preliminary Report of the said Committee has been handed over to H.E the President on 2022 04 25. As such, the Cabinet has decided to appoint a Cabinet Sub-Committee comprising of the following Ministers to study the matters containing in the said Report and submit appropriate recommendations to the Cabinet.\n\n*\tHon. (Prof.) G.L. Peiris\n\tMinister of Foreign Affairs - (Chairman)\n\n*\tHon. Dinesh Gunawardena\n\tMinister of Public Administration, Home Affairs,\n\tProvincial Councils and Local Government\n\n*\tHon. Douglas Devananda\n\tMinister of Fisheries\n\n*\tHon. (Dr.) Ramesh Pathirana\n\tMinister of Education and Minister of Plantation\n\n*\tHon. Ali Sabry\n\tMinister of Finance and Minister of Justice"
