    "date_str": "2023-02-13",
    "description": "Control of single-use plastic/ polythene waste",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11902",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-02-13",
    "decision_details_body": "- Proposals regarding the import, production, sale and domestic use of 07 single-use plastic/polythene products were discussed in the Cabinet meeting held on 30-08-2021 and accordingly, it was decided to appoint an Expert Committee to examine the said proposals and submit a report with recommendations. The proposal submitted by the Minister of Environment to ban the import, production, sale and domestic use of the following plastic products with effect from 01-06-2023 as recommended by the report presented by the said Expert Committee, was approved by the Cabinet.\n\n    \u2022 Single-use plastic drinking straws and stirrers\n    \u2022 Single-use plates, cups (except yogurt cups), spoons, forks and knives, including yogurt spoons made of plastic\n    \u2022 Plastic garlands\n    \u2022 Plastic string hopper trays."
  },
