    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-04-03",
    "decision_details_body": "- Providing a financial subsidy to the farmers for maximum of two hectares as Rs.20,000/- per hectare to purchase fertilizers, taking into consideration a proposal made by the Minister of Agriculture related to supply of fertilizer for paddy\tcultivation in Yala Season on 2023, was approved by the Cabinet."
