    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-05-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. Prime Minister in his capacity as the Minister of \tPublic Administration, Home Affairs, Provincial Councils and Local \tGovernment, taking into consideration the observations submitted by the Election \tCommission regarding the measures that should be taken in relation to public \tofficers who are candidates for the Local Authorities Election 2023 until the \telection is held, to provide the opportunity for such candidates, if they are serving \tin a Government/Semi-Government Institution located within the Local Authority \tArea in which they contest as candidates at the said Election, to report for duty by \ttransferring them to Government/Semi-Government Institutions located outside \tthe relevant Local Authority Area, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
