    "date_str": "2023-10-30",
    "description": "Sri Lanka Institute of Economics and International Trade Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12243",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-10-30",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet has granted approval previously to prepare a Bill to establish Sri Lanka\tInstitute of Economics and International Trade with the objectives of being a platform \tfor research and policy formulation related to economics, international finance and\tinternational trade, providing cutting edge research and studies in the said fields, contribution of ideas for invigorating policy and concepts relating to economics, finance and\tinternational trade and the effective promotion of international trade \tand\tregional trade integration policies. Accordingly, the proposal made by the\tHon. President to publish the Bill prepared by the Legal Draftsman in the Government Gazette and thereafter, submit it to Parliament for approval, was \tapproved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
