    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-01-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- It has been proposed to sign a Memorandum of Understanding pertaining to \tthe Cooperation on Human Resources Development between the General Sir \tJohn Kotelawala Defencce University and the Turkish Aerospace Inc. It is \tpossible to reap many benefits including receiving the opportunity for students \tin the General Sir John Kotelawala Defencce University to participate in the \tInternational Internship Programme at the Turkish Aerospace Inc. as an intern \ttrainee. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity \tas the \tMinister of Defence to sign the proposed Memorandum of\tUnderstanding, was approved by the Cabinet."
