    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-01-08 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- It has been identified the need of re-opening the following Sri Lankan Missions which were temporarily closed during the period of 2021/2022 :\n\n\t(i)\tSri Lanka Consulate General in Cyprus, Nicosia,\n\t(ii)\tSri Lanka Embassy in Baghdad, Iraq,\n\t(iii) \tSri Lanka Consulate General in Frankfurt, Germany.\n\nAccordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Foreign Affairs to re-open the above-mentioned Sri Lankan Missions/Posts abroad, was approved by the Cabinet."
