    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-02-05 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The preparation and implementation of the National Disaster Management Plan in\tterms of the provisions of the Sri Lanka Disaster Management Act, No.13 of 2005 is \tone of the foremost responsibilities of the Disaster Management Centre. \tAccordingly, the National Disaster Management Plan 2023-2030 has been prepared \tin compliance with the Sendai Framework of Action, the Sustainable \tDevelopment \tGoals and the Conventions on Climate Change and in coordination with all the \trelevant agencies. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in \this \tcapacity as the Minister of Defence to table the National Disaster Management Plan \t2023-2030 in\tParliament, was approved by the Cabinet."
