    "description": "Project for the establishment 70 MW, AC ground mounted solar PV power \tplants in 1 to 5 MW, AC capacity",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12465",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-03-25 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet at its meeting held on 2023\u201110\u201102 has granted approval to award \tthe relevant contracts for the supply of 51MW to establish Solar PV Power \tPlants at 5 Grid Substations on Build, Own and Operate basis with 20 years \toperational period under the Project for establishment of 70MW, AC ground \tmounted Solar PV Power Plants in 1-5 MW AC capacity at 11 Grid \tSubstations. Proposals have been re-invited for the supply of 19 MW for the \tremaining 06 Grid Substations. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister \tof Power and Energy to award the contracts for the establishment of  Solar PV \tPower Plants at Ampara, Habarana, Kosgama, Kurunegala, Pannala and \tWeyangoda Grid Substations, to the relevant investors, as recommended by the \tCabinet Appointed Negotiating Committee taking into consideration the \tproposals submitted, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
