    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-04-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Cabinet approved the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies to present the Orders/Regulations/Notifications made under the following Acts and published through the respective Gazette Notifications, for approval in Parliament:\n\n*\tthe Order issued under the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No.13 of 1989 and published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2364/36 dated 2023\u201112\u201131;\n\n*\tthe Order issued under the Ports and Airports Development Levy Act, No.18 of 2011 and published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2364/37 dated 2023\u201112\u201131;\n\n*\tthe Orders issued under the Finance Act, No.25 of 2003 and published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notifications No.2369/27 and No.2374/19 dated 2024\u201102\u201101 and 2024\u201103\u201106 respectively;\n\n*\tthe Notification issued under the Finance Act, No.35 of 2018 (Luxury Tax on Motor Vehicles) and published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2368/24 dated 2024\u201101\u201124;\n\n*\tthe Regulations issued under the Securities and Exchange Commission of Sri Lanka Act, No.19 of 2021 and published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2366/34 dated 2024\u201101\u201112;\n*\tthe Excise Notification No.03/2023 published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2361/44 dated \t2023\u201112\u201108;\n\n*\t the Excise Notification No.04/2023 published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2364/35 dated \t2023\u201112\u201131;\n\n*\tthe Regulations issued under the Casino Business (Regulation) Act, No.17 of 2010 published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notifications No.2366/33 and No.2369/42 dated 2024\u201101\u201112 and 2024\u201102\u201102 respectively."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
