    "date_str": "2024-04-29",
    "description": "Transforming the Mirissa Marine Zone into a Blue Flag Coastal Zone that meets international standards and a Marine Wildlife Sanctuary",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12517",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-04-29 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal to declare the Mirissa Marine Zone as a Marine Wildlife Sanctuary has been taken into discussion at the Cabinet meeting held on 2023\u201105\u201122. A Cabinet Sub-Committee has been appointed then under the Chairmanship of the Hon. Prime Minister to further study on the said proposal with the participation of all relevant parties and submit recommendations to the Cabinet. Accordingly, the said Sub-Committee has submitted its recommendations aiming at increasing the tourism economy in the Southern province by five times by transforming the Mirissa Marine Zone into a Blue Flag Zone that meets international standards and a Marine wildlife Sanctuary. The proposal made by the Hon. Prime Minister to implement the said recommendations through the relevant ministries and institutions in charge of the subject, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
