    "description": "Submission of Orders made under the Colombo Port City Economic Commission Act, No. 11 of 2021",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12629",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- As per the Cabinet decisions dated 2024\u201103\u201125 and 2024\u201104\u201108, the companies named Codegen Innovation (Pvt) Ltd, Port City BPO (Pvt) Ltd, IVIVA PTE Ltd, Echelon Trade (Pvt) and 99X Technology AS, have been designated as Secondary Businesses of Strategic Importance and the proposed exemptions or incentives to such businesses have been published through Orders in the Government Gazette. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Investment Promotion to table the following Orders issued under section 53 of the Colombo Port City Economic Commission Act No.11 of 2021 in Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet. \n\n*\tOrder published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2378/35 dated 2024\u201104\u201105.\n\n*\tOrder published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2380/36 dated 2024\u201104\u201119.\n\n*\tOrder published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2380/33 dated 2024\u201104\u201119.\n\n*\tOrder published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2380/35 dated 2024\u201104\u201119.\n\n*\tOrder published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2380/34 dated 2024\u201104\u201119."
  },
