    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Initial discussions have been held between the Government of Sri Lanka and the Asian Development Bank for the implementation of the Power Sector\t Reforms and Financial Sustainability Programme. The proposed programme consists of 03 sub\u2011programmes and it is expected to receive a loan amount of\tUSD 300 million by USD 100 million for each sub-programme. The\tproposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies to obtain a USD 100 million loan from the Asian Development Bank to finance the proposed sub\u2011programme\u201101 for the implementation of institutional structural reforms in the Ceylon Electricity Board and the Lanka Electricity Company (Pvt) Ltd., was approved by the Cabinet."
