    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12671",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-15 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Approval  of  the  Cabinet  has  been  granted  on  2022\u201101\u201110  to  submit  the  Animal  Welfare  Bill,  to  Parliament  and  accordingly,  the  said  Bill  has  been  submitted  to  Parliament.  The  said  Bill  has  been  submitted  to  the  Sectoral  Oversight  Committee  on  Food  Security  and  Agriculture  for  its  recommendations  and  the  said  Committee  has  proposed  several  amendments  to  the  said  Bill.  The  Legal  Draftsman  has  prepared  the  said  amendments  so  that  it  could  be  presented  at  the  Committee  Stage  of  the  said  Bill  in  Parliament  and  the  clearance  of  the  Attorney  general  has  been  received  for  the  same.  Accordingly,  the  proposal  made  by  the  Minister  of  Agriculture  and  Plantation  Industries  to  present  the  relevant  amendments  at  the  Committee  Stage  of  the  Animal  Welfare  Bill  in  Parliament,  was  approved  by  the  Cabinet."
  },
