    "description": "Amendment  of  the  Constitution  of  the  Democratic  Socialist  Republic  of  Sri  Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12673",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-15 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Policy  approval  of  the  Cabinet  has  been  granted  on  2024\u201107\u201109  to  amend  the paragraph (b) of  Article 83 of  the  Constitution of the Democratic Socialist  Republic of Sri Lanka by the substitution  of  the  words  \u201cto  over  six  years\u201d  with  the  words  \u201cto  over  five  years\u201d as  stated in  paragraph  (b)  of  Article  83  of  the  Constitution.  Accordingly,  the  clearance  of  the  Attorney  General  has  been  received  for  the  Bill  drafted  by  the  Legal  Draftsman.  The  joint  proposal  made  by  the  Hon.  President  and  the  Minister  of  Justice,Prison  Affairs  and  Constitutional  Reforms,  to  publish  the  said  Bill  in  the  Government  Gazette  and  thereafter,  present  the  same  in  Parliament  for  approval,  was  approved  by  the  Cabinet."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
