    "description": "Suraksha  Student  Insurance-2024",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12681",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-15 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The  Cabinet  at  its  meeting  held  on  2024\u201105\u201106  has  granted  approval  to  resume  the  Suraksha  Student  Insurance  Programme  and  invite  bids  from  the  Sri  Lanka  Insurance  Corporation  for  the  same.    Accordingly,  the  Cabinet  Appointed  Negotiating  Committee,  having  evaluated  the  price  proposal  submitted  by  the    Sri  Lanka  Insurance  Corporation,  has  recommended  to  implement  the  Suraksha  Student  Insurance  Programme  at  Rs.  6.027  billion  (excluding  VAT)  for  the  years  of  2024/2025,  2025/2026  and  2026/2027.  Accordingly,  the  joint  proposal  proposal  made  by  the  Hon.  President  in  his  capacity  as  the  Minister  of  Finance,  Economic  Stabilization  and  National  Policies  and  the  Minister  of  Education  to  award  the  contract  for  the  Suraksha  Student  Insurance  to    Sri  Lanka  Insurance  Corporation  General  Limited  for  a  period  of  three  years  as  referred  to  above  and  to  provide  the  parents  death  benefits  entitled  under  the  life  insurance  of  the  Suraksha  Student  Insurance  Programme  for  the  students  of  families  whose  annual  income  is  lesser  than  Rs.  180,000/-  to  the  students  of  families  belonging  to  the  \"Aswesuma\"  programme  as  well,  was  approved  by  the  Cabinet."
  },
