    "description": "Amendment of the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No.3 of 2016",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12703",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-22 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet at its meeting held on 2024\u201103\u201125 has granted approval to amend\tthe National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No.3 of 2016 enabling to \tincrease the National Minimum Wage of Private Sector up to Rs. 17,500/- and\tthe National Minimum Daily Wage up to Rs.700/-. Accordingly, the Bill\tprepared by the Legal Draftsman has received the clearance of the Attorney\tGeneral. The proposal made by the Minister of Labour and Foreign\tEmployment to publish the said Bill in the Government Gazette and submit the\tsame thereafter, to Parliament for approval, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
