    "description": "Procurement for the operation of Tea Sales Shops at the Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayake",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12708",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-29 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- 05 Tea Sales Shops are currently operating in the Departure/ Transit area at Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayake. Bids have been invited under the National Competitive Bidding process for operating the said shops. 08 bidders have submitted bids for the same. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister Ports, Shipping and Aviation to award the relevant contracts to the following Companies as per the recommendation of the Technical Evaluation Committee and the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee, was approved by the Cabinet. \n\n    \u2022 Euro - Scan Exports (Pvt) Limited\n    \u2022 English Tea Shop (UK) Limited\n    \u2022 Sunshine Consumer Lanka Limited\n    \u2022 U H E Exports (Pvt) Limited\n    \u2022 Ceylon Royals Teas (Pvt) Limited"
  },
