    "description": "Proceeds of Crime Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12751",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-08-12 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Approval of the Cabinet has been granted at the Cabinet meeting held on 2024\u201104\u201125 to prepare the Proceeds of Crime Bill in line with the Report of the Committee to develop the Policy and Legal Framework and draft provisions of the proposed law on Proceeds of Crime. Accordingly, the clearance of the Attorney General has been received for the Bill drafted by the Legal Draftsman. The proposal made by the Hon. President to publish the said Bill in the Government Gazette and thereafter, present the same in Parliament for approval, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
