    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-09-02 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- At the cabinet meeting held on 2023\u201104\u201124, it has been decided to appoint an Officials' Committee under the Chairmanship of a Deputy Secretary to the Treasury to submit recommendations regarding the implementation of the 8th Intake of the Interest Free Student Loans Scheme that has been commenced since 2017 for following Degree Courses in Non-State Higher Education Institutes and revision of  fees to be paid to the said Higher Education Institutes for the relevant courses. Therefore, the proposal made by the Minister of Education to implement the following recommendations submitted by the said Committee, was approved by the Cabinet:\n\n*\tRevision of course fees from the 8th Intake of the Interest Free Student Loans Scheme as per the recommendations of the Technical Consultation Committee appointed by the Ministry of Education.\n\n*\tGetting involved the National Savings Bank as well, in addition to the Bank of Ceylon and the People's Bank for the above scheme in order to reduce the financial risk that one bank has to bear .\n\n*\tAnnual review and implementation of the loan interest of the Interest Free \tStudent Loans Scheme subject to a minimum rate of 13% and to a interest rate of 6 months AWPLR+1%.\n\n*\tEnrollment of 7,000 students for each intake commencing from the 8th intake of the Interest Free Student Loans Scheme."
  },
