    "description": "Procurement for supply of Soy Bean and Maize for Sri Lanka Thriposha\tLimited",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12788",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-09-02 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The annual maize and soybean requirement for thriposha production is about 12,000 MT and 6,000 MT respectively. Due to the current shortage of maize and soybeans, the annual supply requirement for thriposha production process cannot be met locally, therefore, the said need has to be met from abroad. Accordingly, bids have been invited for the supply of maize and soybeans under the National Competitive Bidding Procedure. Accordingly, the proposals made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies to award the Contracts as follows  to the lowest substancially responsive bidders as per the recommendations of the Technical Evaluation Committee and the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee, after evaluating the said bids, were approved by the Cabinet.\n\n*\tAward of the procurement for supply of 6,000 MT of Maize to M/s KST Evergreen (Pvt) Ltd.\n\n*\tAward of the procurement for supply of 3,000 MT of soybeans to M/s SDK United Agri Ventures (Pvt) Ltd."
  },
  {
