    "description": "Establishment of 165MW, AC Ground Mounted Solar PV Power Plants in 1-5 MW, AC capacity",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12823",
