    "description": "Construction of 1,996 Housing Units under the Chinese Government's Aid Programme for Low-Income earners",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12885",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-11-05 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- It has been decided to construct 1,996 housing units under the Chinese Government's Aid Programme for Low-Income earners under 03 packages. In order to implement the said Project, bids have been invited from 08 bidders nominated by the Government of China. Cabinet approved the proposal made by the Minister of Rural and Urban Development, Housing and Construction, to award the contracts as follows, based on the recommendations submitted by the Technical Evaluation Committee and the Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee after evaluating the said bids:\n\n* \tPackage 01 - to award the contract for the construction of 575 housing units in Moratuwa and 108 housing units in Kottawa, to M/s China Railway 25th Bureau Group Co. Ltd.\n\n* \tPackage 02 - to award the contract for the construction of 586 housing units in Dematagoda and 112 housing units in Maharagama, to M/s China Harbor Engineering Company Ltd.\n\n* \tPackage 03 - to award the contract for the construction of 615 housing units in Peliyagoda to M/s Shanxi Construction Investment Group Co. Ltd."
  },
