    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-12-23 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development to submit the following Orders published under the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007, to Parliament for approval, was approved by the Cabinet.\n\n*\tThe Order under section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2384/31 dated 2024 05 17.\n\n*\tThe Order under sections 2 and 5 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2395/32 dated 2024 07 31.\n\n*\tThe Order under section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2404/19 dated 2024.10.02.\n\n*\tThe Order under sections 2 and 5 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2406/02 dated 2024.10.14.\n\n*\tThe Order under section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No.48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2408/15 dated 2024.11.01.\n\n*\tThe Order under section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2412/38 dated 2024.11.30."
  },
