    "description": "Operation of International Food Chain Outlets in the Departure/Transit area at the Bandaranaike International Airport (BIA), Katunayake",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=13029",
