    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-04-28 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- It is planned to amend certain Acts falling under the purview of the institutions operating under the Ministry of Industry and Entrepreneurship Development in this year with a view of creating a strong and suitable institutional structure to accelerate the economic transformation of Sri Lanka.  Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Industry and Entrepreneurship Development to amend the following Acts and to include the amendments to the said Acts to the Legislation Programme of the Government in the year 2025, was approved by the Cabinet. \n\n    \u2022 National Gem and Jewellery Authority Act, No. 50 of 1993\n    \u2022 Industrial Development Act, No. 36 of 1969\n    \u2022 The Sri Lanka Institute of Textile and Apparel Act, No. 12 of 2009 \n    \u2022 Sri Lanka Export Development Act, No. 40 of 1979 \n    \u2022 National Enterprise Development Authority Act, No. 17 of 2006\n    \u2022 National Enterprise Development Authority (Amendment) Act, No. 18 of 2014\n    \u2022 National Crafts Council and Allied Institutions Act, No. 35 of 1982\n    \u2022 National Crafts Council and Allied Institutions (Special Provisions) Act, No. 4 of 1996"
