    "num": "14",
    "date_str": "2025-05-07",
    "description": "Amendment of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Acts, No. 36 of 2005 and No. 4 of 2016, and the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=13165",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-05-07 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Approval of the Cabinet was granted at the Cabinet meeting held on 2025\u201104\u201107 to amend the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No.36 of 2005, the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No.4 of 2016 and the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No.3 of 2016 in relation to the increase in the national minimum monthly and daily wages of private sector employees in parallel with the increase in the salaries of public employees. Accordingly, the Legal Draftsman has prepared amending Bills to amend the said Bills, and the clearance of the Attorney General has been received for the same. The proposal made by the Minister of Labour to publish the said amending Bills in the Government Gazette and submit the same thereafter to Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
