    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-09-08 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Development Lotteries Board has invited bids under the National Competitive Bidding Procedure for the procurement for designing, developing, printing and supplying of computer based draw lottery tickets such as Lagna Vasanawa, Kapruka, Ada Kotipathi, Super Ball, Sasiri, Shanida, Supiri Dhana Sampatha and New Draw Lottery Ticket No. 01 (Jaya Sampatha) and New Draw Lottery Ticket No. 02, for a period of one year. Seven (07) bids have been received for the same. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development to award the relevant procurements to the following substantially responsive lowest evaluated bidders, based on the recommendation of the Standing High Level Procurement Committee, was approved by the Cabinet.Name of the BidderLottery BrandToppan Forms (Colombo)Ltd.,Lagna Vasanawa and KaprukaDPJ Holdings (Pvt)Ltd.Ada Kotipathi, Super Ball, Shanida and Supiri Dhana SampathaGrand Export (Pvt)Ltd.SasiriDigiscan Secure Print Solutions (Pvt)Ltd.New Draw Lottery Ticket No. 01 (Jaya Sampatha)New Draw Lottery Ticket No. 02"
