    "description": "Submission of the Appropriation Bill to Parliament - 2026",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=13432",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-09-15 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Approval has been granted at the Cabinet meeting held on 2025-09-08 to publish the Appropriation Bill for the financial year 2026 in the Government Gazette and present the same in Parliament. Accordingly, the following Programme of Parliamentary Sittings for the Appropriation Bill for the year 2026, prepared by the Office of the Leader of the House of Parliament was presented to the Cabinet by the Hon. Prime Minister and the concurrence of the Cabinet was granted for the same.\u00a0 *\tFirst Reading of the Appropriation Bill - 2025-09-26\u00a0 *\tSecond Reading of the Appropriation Bill (Budget Speech) - 2025-11-07\u00a0 *\tDebate on the Second Reading - 2025-11-08 to 2025-11-14\u00a0 *\tDebate on the Third Reading (Committee Stage of the Budget) - 2025-11-15 to 2025-12-05\u00a0 *\tDivision on the Third Reading - 2025-12-05"
  },
