    "decision_details_body": "- Approval has been granted to amend the Post Office Security Fund Ordinance, at the Cabinet meeting held on 2022\u201103\u201107. Since it has been proposed to totally amend certain sections of the said Ordinance and to insert new sections, it has been found more appropriate to introduce a new Act to suit the present needs, instead of further amending the said Ordinance. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Health and Mass Media to instruct the Legal Draftsman to repeal the Post Office Security Fund Ordinance No.1 of 1931 (Chapter 282) and prepare a new Bill, was approved by the Cabinet."
