    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-11-03 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Approval of the Cabinet has been granted previously to implement the Sustainable Tourism Sector Development Programme (STSDP) utilizing funds to be obtained from the Asian Development Bank and to conduct loan negotiations for the same. Accordingly, negotiations have been held to obtain USD 100 million, as USD 70 million Concessional Ordinary Capital Resources and USD 30 million from Regular Ordinary Capital Resources to implement the said Programme under the terms and conditions recommended by the Public Debt Management Office. Required clearance for obtaining the said loan facility has been granted by the Attorney General\u2019s Department and the Central Bank of Sri Lanka. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development to enter into Agreements with the Asian Development Bank to obtain the said loan, enabling to finance the activities of the Sustainable Tourism Sector Development Programme was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
